  Scenario Outline: every rendered copy carries the step and matches a fresh render
    When <copy> is read
    Then it contains the diagram passage's command `aof diagram plan <ref> <ADR-NNN> --slug <slug> --json`
    And it is byte-identical to what `aof work update` renders from the current source

