  Scenario: the architect's tools are not widened to draw
    When `src/bundle/frozen-set.jsonc` is read
    Then the architect's tools are still exactly `Read, Grep, Glob, Bash, Write, Edit`
    And `src/bundle/agents/aof-architect.md` does not ask for the `Skill` tool

  Scenario: the commands the prose names are the commands that exist
    When `aof diagram plan` and `aof diagram export` are looked up in the command registry
    Then each resolves to a registered command, `diagram:plan` and `diagram:export`
    And every flag the passage passes to them (`--slug`, `--json`) is one the command accepts
